  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">조별로 다른 해수의 1000g당 염류양을 주고,</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">1.염분</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2.염화나트륨의 염분비</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3.염화마그네슘의 염분비</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">를 계산한 후</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; min-height: 13.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">칠판에 결과를 적으라고 하니,</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">염분비가 일정하다는 걸 눈치껏 알아냄.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; min-height: 13.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">교과서에 제시된 해수는 3종류여서</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">4종류의 염류량을 계산해서 각 조에 제시함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Helvetica; min-height: 13.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><br></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2577DD4F547004FB24' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2748E938547005000B' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2455B3465470050436' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/237BFA3C5470050B2A' class='txc-image' /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24543F375470051135' class='txc-image' /></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
